{"id":"62799","name":"盐渍香椿","author":"亲亲妈","authorId":"529034","desc":"","cover":"images/62799/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"香椿","amount":"1斤"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香椿买回来理一下。","img":"images/62799/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"浸洗。","img":"images/62799/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"略修剪，剪去老的蒂头。","img":"images/62799/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅内入冷水煮开。","img":"images/62799/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"下香椿烫下。","img":"images/62799/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"看着、等到香椿颜色变绿。","img":"images/62799/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"立刻就捞起来。","img":"images/62799/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盆用热水烫下，放一层烫好的香椿。","img":"images/62799/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少少放一些盐。","img":"images/62799/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"这样一层香棒、一层少少的盐的铺上去，直到弄好所有的香椿。","img":"images/62799/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"用筷子稍稍压压紧实。","img":"images/62799/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒掉盆底的水。","img":"images/62799/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"面上再撒些盐，盖上保鲜膜，入冰箱冷藏约半天。即可食用。","img":"images/62799/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"整个冰箱都是香香的味道~~","img":"images/62799/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"就这么一根一根拿了当零嘴儿啊别看梗粗粗的，其实很嫩的，唇齿留香呢。。。","img":"images/62799/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}